# install-age.manifest — Explicit list of scaffold files to copy into a target project.
#
# Format (one entry per line, relative to template root):
#   <src>                              → dst defaults to src (strip leading template/)
#   <src> > <dst>                      → dst differs from src
#   <src> > <dst> :: <flag>[,<flag>]   → with flags
#
# Flags:
#   exec    chmod +x the destination
#   fill    replace <project-name> with the project name
#   rel-mdh replace __REL_MDH__ with the computed engine path (relative from target)
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. The installer skips existing target files.
#
# This manifest intentionally EXCLUDES template-internal artifacts:
#   - docs/articles/                  (methodology articles, not project content)
#   - docs/architecture/mission-driver-baseline.md   (engine's own baseline)
#   - docs/audits/mission-driver-*/   (engine's own audit records)
#   - docs/backlog/mission-driver-*-roadmap.md, demo-roadmap.md  (engine's roadmaps)
#   - docs/discussions/2026-*         (engine's own discussions)
#   - docs/logs/2026/                 (engine's own daily logs)
#   - docs/plans/mission-driver-*/, docs/plans/2026-*  (engine's own plans)
#   - docs/requirements/mission-driver-convergence-and-cost-optimization.md
#   - docs/retrospectives/template-design-decisions.md  (template's evolution record)
# When adding new scaffold files to the template, add them HERE too.

# --- engine bootstrap (install-only artifacts from template/install/) ---
# Consumer-facing shim + env + mission defaults. Diverge from dogfood root files —
# see template/install/README.md. Do NOT swap for the root dogfood versions.
template/install/tools/mission-driver.sh > tools/mission-driver.sh :: exec
template/install/.env.example > .env.example :: rel-mdh
template/install/missions/base.json > missions/base.json
template/install/missions/demo.json > missions/demo.json
template/install/missions/onboarding.json > missions/onboarding.json
template/install/docs/backlog/demo-roadmap.md > docs/backlog/demo-roadmap.md

# --- root ---
template/AGENTS.md

# --- docs root ---
template/docs/index.md

